<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>To obtain a visa for a visit to the Republic of Belarus you should:<br>
 </strong><br>
 <strong>1. Find the Embassy / Consulate of the Republic of Belarus in your country.<br>
 </strong>To find a representative of the Republic of Belarus for applying<strong> </strong>for a visa in your country, you can use this link:<br>
 <strong>http://www.belembassy.org/index_eng.html<br>
 </strong><br>
 <strong>2. Apply to the Embassy / Consulate of the Republic of Belarus in your country, the following documents *:<br>
 </strong><br>
 1. <strong>Completed and signed <span style="text-decoration: underline;">visa application form</span> with a glued-in <span style="text-decoration: underline;">color photo</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">(photo must meet the definitions specified in ISO / IEC 19794-5: size 35×45 mm, full face, the light background, the clarity of high quality, wrinkle- and ink-free, 70 – 80 percent of picture size should be your face, the duration of the picture – no more than 6 months);<br>
 2<strong>. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Passport</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">(must have at least two blank pages intended for visas and passport validity should not expire in less than 90 days after the expiry of the visa) and a copy of passport pages with personal data<br>
 3. <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Health insurance</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">(date and number of days specified in the policy must meet the deadline and the number of days of the requested visa);<br>
 4. <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Original</span> or <span style="text-decoration: underline;">a copy of the invitation</span></strong> from the standard pattern of the Belarusian side.<br>
 5. <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Visa fee</span></strong></p>
<p>___________________</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">* Before submitting documents for visa at the Embassy / Consulate of the Republic of Belarus in your country you need to clarify in each case information about the required documents and about the time of receipt of documents</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: small;"><strong>To visit Belarus you will need to apply for a visa at the Embassy of the Republic of Belarus in your country and Institute for Command Engineers of the Ministry for Emergency Situations of the Republic of Belarus (ICE) should send you a formal invitation.</strong></span></p>


